WEBVTT

01:03.380 --> 01:04.930
<b>Black! It's black!</b>

01:06.930 --> 01:10.270
<b>YANGYANG VILLAGE</b>

01:11.720 --> 01:14.720
<b>This... This is... Demonic abyss!</b>

01:15.480 --> 01:17.060
<b>Could it be an equipment error?</b>

01:20.190 --> 01:25.220
<b>Black can appear only when there
are over ten thousand dead spirits...</b>

01:25.880 --> 01:30.150
<b><i>This is the Pit of Ten Thousand Corpses 
that's completely forbidden to humans.</i></b>

01:30.840 --> 01:34.650
<b><i>If we don't investigate and deal 
with this as soon as possible,</i></b>

01:34.650 --> 01:37.100
<b><i>that land will descend into hell!</i></b>

03:24.880 --> 03:30.100
<b>VERSATILE MAGE SEASON 7</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:39.290
<b><i>This year's World Academy Tournament 
will begin its preliminaries tomorrow!</i></b>

03:39.290 --> 03:43.560
<b><i>Mo Fan's match is currently broadcasting
 from the Pearl Institute.</i></b>

03:43.560 --> 03:44.850
<b><i>He's the candidate from Pearl</i></b>

03:44.850 --> 03:47.870
<b><i>most likely to compete in the 
World Academy Tournament this year.</i></b>

03:47.870 --> 03:50.300
<b><i>He only needs to defeat 
three more opponents!</i></b>

03:55.920 --> 03:58.930
<b>This is that "amazing" classmate of yours?</b>

03:59.460 --> 04:01.350
<b>What's wrong with the Demon King today?</b>

04:01.670 --> 04:04.250
<b>Finally, someone to put
Mo Fan in his place.</b>

04:04.250 --> 04:05.900
<b>He was being too cocky before,</b>

04:05.900 --> 04:10.180
<b>saying something about how
he's got the tournament in the bag.</b>

04:10.640 --> 04:12.230
<b>I heard the Imperial Capital Institute</b>

04:12.230 --> 04:14.250
<b>has confirmed their candidate 
will be Mu Ningxue.</b>

04:14.250 --> 04:16.010
<b>No wonder Mo Fan is so fierce.</b>

04:16.790 --> 04:18.940
<b>I heard that he was openly 
pursuing Mu Ningxue</b>

04:18.940 --> 04:20.890
<b>when he went there on exchange.</b>

04:20.890 --> 04:24.830
<b>This time, he's going to beat
the top fifty elites at Pearl</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:28.640
<b>just to get with Mu Ningxue!</b>

04:32.610 --> 04:34.670
<b>If this is all you've got,</b>

04:34.670 --> 04:37.140
<b>then you should go train a few more years!</b>

04:53.170 --> 04:54.810
<b>Top fifty in the whole school?</b>

04:55.360 --> 04:57.920
<b>That's it? I didn't even break a sweat.</b>

04:57.920 --> 04:59.110
<b>Mo Fan's ferocious!</b>

04:59.110 --> 05:01.540
<b>Even an ice expert with 
elemental advantage is useless!</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.520
<b>Is this the strength of the 
Vig Devil of the Fire Department?</b>

05:03.520 --> 05:05.300
<b>First, he curb-stomped the 
whole Fire Department.</b>

05:05.300 --> 05:07.060
<b>Now, he's going to wreck the whole school!</b>

05:11.470 --> 05:15.350
<b>Good stuff. Just two more
 wins, and you qualify.</b>

05:15.350 --> 05:18.390
<b>Then we can go and welcome all the 
pretty girls from the different schools!</b>

05:18.880 --> 05:21.500
<b>Pearl really is too small.
It's really not...</b>

05:21.970 --> 05:24.350
<b>It's really not a match for me!</b>

05:24.350 --> 05:26.890
<b>I wish to go up against big 
shots from all over the world!</b>

05:27.270 --> 05:29.390
<b>Congratulations. You're one step 
closer to qualifying.</b>

05:30.080 --> 05:32.890
<b>Your next opponent should be Dongfang Lie.</b>

05:33.360 --> 05:34.150
<b>Him?</b>

05:35.370 --> 05:38.470
<b>The Dongfang family has a very 
long lineage of fire magic,</b>

05:38.470 --> 05:41.770
<b>and Dongfang Lie is the strongest 
amongst their younger generation.</b>

05:41.770 --> 05:45.430
<b>He's a strong competitor this year.</b>

05:45.430 --> 05:46.600
<b>Don't underestimate him.</b>

05:47.120 --> 05:49.680
<b>What? You have something against him?</b>

05:50.030 --> 05:52.160
<b>He has a younger brother 
named Dongfang Ming.</b>

05:52.160 --> 05:54.720
<b>I beat him up during the 
Judgment Council Internship,</b>

05:54.720 --> 05:58.220
<b>so Dongfang Lie has provoked me a few 
times, purposefully or otherwise.</b>

05:58.620 --> 05:59.890
<b>Isn't that perfect, then?</b>

05:59.890 --> 06:02.310
<b>I've never liked those fire monkeys 
from the Dongfang family.</b>

06:03.200 --> 06:05.700
<b>The ultimate prodigy from 
the Dongfang family, is it?</b>

06:05.700 --> 06:07.790
<b>Beating a prodigy will be interesting!</b>

06:09.810 --> 06:10.760
<b>Mo Fan...</b>

06:12.770 --> 06:15.090
<b>Allow me to introduce to you my brother.</b>

06:15.090 --> 06:17.440
<b>My brother by blood, Ai Jiangtu.</b>

06:17.440 --> 06:18.270
<b>Hello.</b>

06:19.480 --> 06:20.270
<b>Hello.</b>

06:20.270 --> 06:24.850
<b>You're strong. I can tell you
held back a lot of your true strength.</b>

06:25.250 --> 06:26.880
<b>You've got good eyes.</b>

06:26.880 --> 06:28.640
<b>Are you a student here at Pearl, too?</b>

06:28.640 --> 06:29.950
<b>No.</b>

06:29.950 --> 06:32.790
<b>Well, my brother's actually 
pre-selected for the National...</b>

06:34.390 --> 06:37.030
<b>Either way, I have confidence in you.</b>

06:37.030 --> 06:39.810
<b>I hope you can make it onto 
the National Academy Team.</b>

06:40.450 --> 06:41.860
<b>I appreciate the vote of confidence!</b>

06:41.860 --> 06:43.220
<b>Let's go get some food.</b>

06:43.790 --> 06:46.710
<b>Great! Let me call some girls up...</b>

06:58.720 --> 07:00.180
<b>You, get over here!</b>

07:01.180 --> 07:03.430
<b>Young masters Ming and Lie,
is something wrong?</b>

07:03.430 --> 07:06.220
<b>You know very well that we 
come here every evening.</b>

07:06.220 --> 07:09.310
<b>Don't you know to reserve that 
table by the lake for us?</b>

07:10.000 --> 07:12.880
<b>My apologies. I actually did tell them,</b>

07:12.880 --> 07:14.390
<b>but those people there...</b>

07:14.390 --> 07:18.310
<b>They said they haven't ever heard
of you two and just sat down.</b>

07:21.180 --> 07:23.350
<b>Brother, it's Mo Fan!</b>

07:28.080 --> 07:29.980
<b>You're Mo Fan?</b>

07:29.980 --> 07:31.850
<b>Yes. Who're you?</b>

07:32.170 --> 07:33.180
<b>I'm Dongfang Lie.</b>

07:33.520 --> 07:34.970
<b>Oh. And?</b>

07:35.690 --> 07:38.370
<b>I heard you're my next opponent,</b>

07:38.370 --> 07:41.970
<b>so I came over to see just what you are.</b>

07:43.840 --> 07:46.140
<b>I don't mind getting rid of you today.</b>

07:46.140 --> 07:49.850
<b>I mean, I wouldn't want to waste 
my weekend fighting some nobody.</b>

07:49.850 --> 07:51.220
<b>That'd be a bummer.</b>

07:51.930 --> 07:53.230
<b>Who're you calling a nobody?!</b>

07:53.230 --> 07:55.100
<b>Don't get too cocky, Mo Fan!</b>

08:01.740 --> 08:03.680
<b>Calm down, calm down.</b>

08:07.930 --> 08:08.820
<b>Stop.</b>

08:09.900 --> 08:14.950
<b>Why don't both of you show off your 
full strength in the tournament?</b>

08:14.950 --> 08:19.180
<b>Then the National Academy teachers 
would be able to see your talents too.</b>

08:19.560 --> 08:20.390
<b>That's right.</b>

08:20.390 --> 08:22.320
<b>Unsanctioned fights are forbidden on campus.</b>

08:22.320 --> 08:24.200
<b>You'll both be disqualified.</b>

08:25.510 --> 08:27.310
<b>You'd best savor every bit of this meal.</b>

08:27.620 --> 08:31.170
<b>Tomorrow, I'm sending
you to the hospital.</b>

08:31.810 --> 08:35.230
<b>The only way you'll be 
eating is through a tube.</b>

08:38.570 --> 08:40.680
<b>All right, let's resume.</b>

08:41.010 --> 08:44.310
<b>Don't let two fire monkeys 
ruin our great vibes.</b>

08:45.960 --> 08:48.020
<b>Those Dongfang family
guys sure can put on airs.</b>

08:49.070 --> 08:50.020
<b>Let's enjoy ourselves.</b>

08:52.770 --> 08:54.020
<b>That's it?</b>

08:54.510 --> 08:57.430
<b>I won't be able to relax until 
we teach that punk a lesson.</b>

08:57.430 --> 09:00.180
<b>That must've been Ai Jiangtu.</b>

09:00.500 --> 09:02.310
<b>Ai Jiangtu?</b>

09:02.310 --> 09:05.020
<b>Ai Jiangtu has been pre-selected
for the National Academy Team.</b>

09:05.020 --> 09:08.390
<b>It's very likely he's
even the team captain.</b>

09:08.820 --> 09:11.840
<b>If I enter the National 
Academy Team in the future,</b>

09:11.840 --> 09:13.970
<b>I'll have to report to him.</b>

09:13.970 --> 09:16.370
<b>He's that big of a deal?</b>

09:16.370 --> 09:18.170
<b>Don't feel too bad.</b>

09:18.170 --> 09:21.850
<b>You can get a front-row seat tomorrow</b>

09:21.850 --> 09:24.560
<b>and watch me beat
Mo Fan senseless up close!</b>

09:33.060 --> 09:36.060
<b>MO FAN VS DONGFANG LIE</b>

09:40.000 --> 09:41.730
<b>What's up with Mo Fan?</b>

09:43.060 --> 09:44.960
<b>I thought that guy was pretty ballsy.</b>

09:44.960 --> 09:46.890
<b>But he's just going to get 
cold feet at the last minute?</b>

09:48.330 --> 09:49.620
<b>What a shame.</b>

09:49.620 --> 09:51.720
<b>I wanted to see him beg for mercy.</b>

09:53.530 --> 09:54.920
<b>Where did Mo Fan go?</b>

09:54.920 --> 09:56.500
<b>There are only ten minutes left.</b>

09:56.500 --> 09:57.720
<b>Why is he still not here?</b>

09:58.160 --> 09:59.760
<b>I don't know either.</b>

09:59.760 --> 10:03.680
<b>After we left last night, he and Zhao 
Manyan kept chatting for a while.</b>

10:10.070 --> 10:11.000
<b>Mo Fan?</b>

10:13.820 --> 10:15.980
<b>Shouldn't you be at the 
tournament right now,</b>

10:15.980 --> 10:17.470
<b>preparing for your preliminary match?</b>

10:17.470 --> 10:18.850
<b>I overslept...</b>

10:19.400 --> 10:21.450
<b>Come with me. I'm headed there anyway.</b>

10:22.830 --> 10:24.790
<b>Why do you look so exhausted?</b>

10:24.790 --> 10:26.390
<b>Did you stay up last night?</b>

10:26.390 --> 10:29.810
<b>Why'd you stay up so late 
knowing you had a match today?</b>

10:31.510 --> 10:33.000
<b>It's just Dongfang Lie.</b>

10:33.000 --> 10:34.470
<b>I never took him seriously.</b>

10:36.470 --> 10:37.750
<b>Mo Fan's here!</b>

10:39.470 --> 10:41.470
<b>Oho. So many people.</b>

10:42.210 --> 10:45.350
<b>You and Dongfang Lie are both well-known 
across Pearl Institute now.</b>

10:45.350 --> 10:47.440
<b>A match between you two
 is bound to fill seats.</b>

10:47.440 --> 10:49.850
<b>A lot of elites are also 
going to be watching.</b>

10:49.850 --> 10:51.710
<b>Go show them what you've got. Good luck!</b>

10:53.430 --> 10:56.430
<b>Ready up. Contestants, enter the stage.</b>

11:04.540 --> 11:07.520
<b>My phone... Have you seen my cellphone?</b>

11:12.320 --> 11:14.190
<b>Losing track of your stuff 
over dinner...</b>

11:14.190 --> 11:15.430
<b>You didn't even notice it died.</b>

11:16.650 --> 11:18.220
<b>Thanks for charging it!</b>

11:19.140 --> 11:21.270
<b>Can we get started?</b>

11:21.270 --> 11:23.020
<b>I'm tired of waiting!</b>

11:23.340 --> 11:25.000
<b>Match start!</b>

11:25.000 --> 11:26.060
<b>Coming!</b>

11:27.130 --> 11:28.320
<b>Do your best!</b>

11:39.520 --> 11:41.970
<b>ZHANG XIAOHOU HAS BEEN KILLED IN
ACTION AT TIN CITY, WHITE RIDGE!</b>

11:42.250 --> 11:43.990
<b>Zhang Xiaohou is dead?</b>

11:45.120 --> 11:46.740
<b>Xiaohou's dead?</b>

11:47.710 --> 11:49.890
<b>He's... He's really dead...?</b>

11:49.890 --> 11:50.710
<b>Hey!</b>

11:51.120 --> 11:51.820
<b>Hey!</b>

11:54.510 --> 11:56.720
<b><i>Put your phone away! 
Are you going to fight or not?</i></b>

11:59.810 --> 12:00.740
<b>That's not possible.</b>

12:00.740 --> 12:02.390
<b>This isn't possible.</b>

12:02.390 --> 12:05.390
<b>If you continue, I'm going to 
declare that you forfeit right now!</b>

12:06.090 --> 12:08.470
<b>Wait, Mr. Wei!</b>

12:08.920 --> 12:09.970
<b>What is it?</b>

12:11.470 --> 12:13.020
<b>He's got cold feet, huh?</b>

12:13.790 --> 12:16.100
<b>Acting all ballsy and looking for excuses.</b>

12:16.100 --> 12:17.850
<b>I've been waiting for this day!</b>

12:18.370 --> 12:21.350
<b>Are you blind? Can't you
see he's not okay?</b>

12:21.950 --> 12:25.430
<b>Time's up. Don't waste time 
talking about other stuff.</b>

12:25.430 --> 12:29.100
<b>Hurry up and fight! Fight! Fight!</b>

12:29.630 --> 12:31.400
<b>The match has officially begun.</b>

12:31.400 --> 12:33.500
<b>I must maintain impartiality.</b>

12:33.500 --> 12:36.150
<b>The rules weren't made for any one person.</b>

12:36.870 --> 12:38.750
<b>I'm asking you one final time:</b>

12:38.750 --> 12:40.440
<b>are you still going to fight?</b>

12:41.580 --> 12:43.140
<b>Still acting?</b>

12:43.140 --> 12:45.010
<b>Even if you're backing out now,</b>

12:45.010 --> 12:46.720
<b>you still have to take a punch from me!</b>

12:48.970 --> 12:50.390
<b>Shattering Fist!</b>

12:52.480 --> 12:54.060
<b>Mo Fan! Dodge!</b>

13:01.600 --> 13:03.970
<b>Get the hell... away from me!</b>

13:04.780 --> 13:05.810
<b>Flame Fist!</b>

13:17.580 --> 13:20.020
<b>Yanji! Use Flame Princess Possession!</b>

13:21.020 --> 13:23.020
<b>Quick, activate your armor! Your shield!</b>

13:32.680 --> 13:34.640
<b>What... What kind of magic is that?</b>

13:34.640 --> 13:37.100
<b>Mo Fan! Mo Fan!</b>

13:41.640 --> 13:45.270
<b>FIRE DEPARTMENT CHALLENGER</b>

13:42.910 --> 13:45.270
<b>Mo Fan. Mo Fan!</b>

13:49.620 --> 13:51.790
<b>I've finally found you, Fan!</b>

13:51.790 --> 13:53.310
<b>I knew you were still alive!</b>

13:56.640 --> 14:02.970
<b><i>Xiaohou... You told me that you were 
studying Wind and Earth magic.</i></b>

14:02.970 --> 14:05.470
<b><i>That anyone can die, but you never would.</i></b>

14:07.850 --> 14:10.810
<b><i>Are you going back on 
your word, you bastard?!</i></b>

14:12.160 --> 14:12.970
<b>Mo Fan.</b>

14:16.400 --> 14:17.310
<b>You're here.</b>

14:21.760 --> 14:23.310
<b>This is your new cell phone.</b>

14:23.310 --> 14:25.110
<b>It's still your old number.</b>

14:25.110 --> 14:26.720
<b>A lot of people have left you messages.</b>

14:30.040 --> 14:31.840
<b><i>Brother, what's up with you?</i></b>

14:31.840 --> 14:33.010
<b><i>You just needed one more win</i></b>

14:33.010 --> 14:34.960
<b><i>and you'd qualify for the
World Academy Tournament.</i></b>

14:34.960 --> 14:36.850
<b><i>Why did you drop out of the match?</i></b>

14:37.190 --> 14:39.210
<b><i>Mo Fan, what happened?</i></b>

14:39.210 --> 14:40.850
<b><i>You need to talk to us!</i></b>

14:40.850 --> 14:43.910
<b><i>Mo Fan, I heard that you've 
dropped out of the match.</i></b>

14:43.910 --> 14:45.680
<b><i>We all have great confidence in you.</i></b>

14:45.680 --> 14:47.620
<b><i>If there's a problem, you can talk to me.</i></b>

14:49.520 --> 14:51.680
<b>You're just giving up on the
World Academy Tournament?</b>

14:52.340 --> 14:55.680
<b>Compared to the life of a friend, the 
World Academy Tournament is nothing.</b>

14:56.160 --> 14:57.220
<b>But...</b>

14:58.120 --> 15:01.930
<b>Whether he's alive or dead,
I must find him.</b>

15:01.930 --> 15:04.850
<b>He's been my companion since
 childhood. We've been to hell and back.</b>

15:04.850 --> 15:08.830
<b>He's the one who never gave up looking 
for me even after I became a demon!</b>

15:10.750 --> 15:14.340
<b>I won't allow him to just 
disappear like that.</b>

15:14.340 --> 15:16.640
<b>Disappearing with just 
one short text message!</b>

15:17.360 --> 15:21.040
<b>If he's really dead, then I need 
to confirm it with my own eyes.</b>

15:22.370 --> 15:23.950
<b>And if he's still alive...</b>

15:23.950 --> 15:26.810
<b>No matter where he is, be it a sea 
of blood or a mountain of corpses,</b>

15:26.810 --> 15:29.770
<b>I will carve a bloody 
path to bring him home!</b>

15:30.490 --> 15:31.450
<b>I understand.</b>

15:32.070 --> 15:33.370
<b>What do you want me to do?</b>

15:34.390 --> 15:36.270
<b>We're up against undead this time.</b>

15:37.350 --> 15:40.520
<b>I want you to come with me to Tin City.</b>

15:41.090 --> 15:43.660
<b>The Blood Clan is undead as well.</b>

15:43.660 --> 15:44.930
<b>You've got the right person.</b>

15:45.590 --> 15:47.430
<b>Thank you, Liu Ru.</b>

15:47.950 --> 15:50.940
<b>It's my honor to be able to serve you.</b>

15:57.530 --> 16:00.270
<b>I've never seen a Safe Zone 
as grand as this one!</b>

16:00.780 --> 16:03.100
<b>Tin City is divided into the 
Inner City and the Outer City.</b>

16:03.100 --> 16:05.680
<b>This Safe Zone is its outer wall.</b>

16:05.680 --> 16:09.730
<b>Right now, everyone has been
moved inside the city walls.</b>

16:09.730 --> 16:11.850
<b>So the situation is very dire.</b>

16:12.460 --> 16:15.740
<b>Outside of the city... 
is no longer safe for anyone.</b>

17:57.270 --> 18:26.140
<b>PREVIEW</b>

17:57.560 --> 17:58.220
<b>What is that?!</b>

17:59.300 --> 18:03.020
<b><i>The danger outside of Tin City 
is way worse than I thought.</i></b>

18:03.020 --> 18:04.310
<b>Hey! Gather!</b>

18:09.650 --> 18:11.600
<b>We didn't hit an undead nest, did we?!</b>

18:11.930 --> 18:14.470
<b>Damn it! There's more and more blood here!</b>

18:14.470 --> 18:15.720
<b>There's gonna be a big one!</b>

18:17.890 --> 18:21.020
<b>Be with me! All of you, be with me!</b>

18:21.020 --> 18:21.770
<b>Lightning Seal!</b>

18:23.640 --> 18:24.680
<b>Blood Beast Boots!</b>
